<!DOCTYPE html>
<html dir="rtl" lang="ar">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>أنشئ متجرك مجاناً — دُكّان</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Kufi+Arabic:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--red:#0B1F3A; --gold:#0D9488; --gold2:#2DD4BF; --ink:#1c1917; --mut:#78716c; --line:#e7e5e4}
*{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0}
body{font-family:'Noto Kufi Arabic',sans-serif; background:#0d0a08; min-height:100vh; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:1.5rem 1rem; position:relative; overflow-x:hidden}
body::before{content:''; position:absolute; width:480px; height:480px; border-radius:50%; background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(11,31,58,.5),transparent 70%); top:-160px; right:-140px}
body::after{content:''; position:absolute; width:380px; height:380px; border-radius:50%; background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(13,148,136,.3),transparent 70%); bottom:-140px; left:-120px}
.su-card{position:relative; z-index:1; background:rgba(255,255,255,.97); border-radius:24px; padding:2rem 1.8rem 1.5rem; width:min(440px,100%); box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.5), 0 0 0 1px rgba(45,212,191,.25)}
.su-back{display:inline-block; color:var(--gold); font-size:.82rem; font-weight:800; text-decoration:none; margin-bottom:.8rem}
.su-card h1{font-size:1.4rem; font-weight:900; color:var(--ink)}
.su-sub{color:var(--mut); font-size:.86rem; margin:.2rem 0 1.1rem}
.su-gift{background:#F0FDFA; border:1.5px solid #99F6E4; color:#0A4A38; border-radius:12px; padding:.6rem .9rem; font-size:.83rem; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:1rem}
.su-err{background:#fef2f2; border:1.5px solid #fecaca; color:#b91c1c; border-radius:12px; padding:.6rem .9rem; font-size:.83rem; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:1rem}
.su-google{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:.6rem; border:1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; padding:.75rem; font-weight:800; font-size:.92rem; color:var(--ink); text-decoration:none; background:#fff; font-family:inherit; transition:all .18s}
.su-google:hover{border-color:#4285F4; box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(66,133,244,.2)}
.su-or{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.8rem; margin:1rem 0; color:#a8a29e; font-size:.75rem}
.su-or::before,.su-or::after{content:''; flex:1; height:1px; background:var(--line)}
.su-card label{display:block; font-size:.8rem; font-weight:800; color:#44403c; margin-bottom:.8rem}
.su-card input[type="text"],.su-card input[type="password"]{width:100%; margin-top:.3rem; border:1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px; padding:.68rem .9rem; font-size:.92rem; font-family:inherit; background:#fafaf9}
.su-card input:focus{outline:none; border-color:var(--gold); background:#fff; box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(13,148,136,.12)}
.su-pass{position:relative; display:block}
.su-pass input{padding-left:2.6rem}
.su-pass button{position:absolute; left:.5rem; top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%); background:none; border:none; cursor:pointer; font-size:1.05rem}
.su-cap{display:flex; gap:.6rem; align-items:center; margin-top:.3rem}
.su-cap span{background:#F0FDFA; border:1.5px solid #99F6E4; color:#0A4A38; font-weight:900; padding:.68rem 1rem; border-radius:12px; white-space:nowrap}
.su-cap input{flex:1}
.hp{position:absolute; left:-9999px; opacity:0; height:0}
.su-submit{width:100%; border:none; border-radius:14px; padding:.85rem; font-size:1.02rem; font-weight:900; font-family:inherit; color:#fff; cursor:pointer; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0B1F3A,#0E7C5B 55%,#0D9488); box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(11,31,58,.4); margin-top:.4rem}
.su-submit:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}
.su-perks{margin:1.2rem 0; padding:.9rem 1rem; background:#fafaf9; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; font-size:.82rem; color:#57534e; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:.4rem}
.su-alt{text-align:center; font-size:.85rem; color:var(--mut)}
.su-alt a{color:var(--gold); font-weight:800; text-decoration:none}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="su-card">
    <a href="/" class="su-back">→ رجوع للرئيسية</a>
    <h1>🚀 أنشئ متجرك مجاناً</h1>
    <p class="su-sub">دقيقة واحدة وتصير جاهز — بلا بطاقة دفع ولا خبرة</p>
    <% if (typeof trialDays !== 'undefined' && trialDays > 0) { %><div class="su-gift">🎁 سجل الآن واحصل على <b><%= trialDays %> أيام</b> احترافية مجاناً</div><% } %>
    <% if (typeof ref !== 'undefined' && ref) { %><div class="su-gift">🎁 سُجلت عبر دعوة من متجر «<%= refName %>»</div><% } %>
    <% if (error) { %><div class="su-err">⚠️ <%= error %></div><% } %>
    <a class="su-google" href="/login/google">
      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="#4285F4" d="M23.5 12.3c0-.9-.1-1.5-.3-2.2H12v4.3h6.5c-.1 1.1-.8 2.7-2.4 3.8l-.1.1 3.5 2.7.1.1c2.1-2 3.9-4.9 3.9-8.8z"/><path fill="#34A853" d="M12 24c3.2 0 6-1.1 7.9-2.9l-3.8-2.9c-1 .7-2.4 1.2-4.1 1.2-3.2 0-5.9-2.1-6.8-5l-.1.1-3.7 2.9v.1C3.3 21.3 7.3 24 12 24z"/><path fill="#FBBC05" d="M5.2 14.4c-.2-.7-.4-1.5-.4-2.4s.1-1.7.4-2.4l-.1-.1-3.6-2.8-.1.1C.5 8.7 0 10.2 0 12s.5 3.3 1.4 4.7l3.8-2.3z"/><path fill="#EA4335" d="M12 4.7c1.8 0 3 .8 3.7 1.4l3.3-3.2C17.9 1.1 15.2 0 12 0 7.3 0 3.3 2.7 1.4 6.7l3.8 2.9c.9-2.8 3.6-4.9 6.8-4.9z"/></svg>
      سجّل بحساب جيميل بضغطة
    </a>
    <div class="su-or"><span>أو بالطريقة الكلاسيكية</span></div>
    <form method="post" action="/signup">
      <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
      <% if (typeof ref !== 'undefined' && ref) { %><input type="hidden" name="ref" value="<%= ref %>"><% } %>
      <label>اسم المتجر<input type="text" name="name" required placeholder="مثال: عطور الشام"></label>
      <label>اسم المستخدم (للدخول)<input type="text" name="username" required dir="ltr" placeholder="hmet-furniture"></label>
      <label>كلمة المرور
        <span class="su-pass"><input type="password" name="password" id="suPass" required minlength="8" placeholder="8 أحرف على الأقل"><button type="button" id="suEye">👁️</button></span>
      </label>
      <label>رقم الهاتف (اختياري)<input type="text" name="phone" dir="ltr" placeholder="07XX XXX XXXX"></label>
      <label>أثبت أنك إنسان: <%= cap.a %> + <%= cap.b %> = ؟
        <span class="su-cap"><span><%= cap.a %> + <%= cap.b %> =</span><input type="text" name="answer" required autocomplete="off" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="الإجابة"></span>
      </label>
      <input type="text" name="website" class="hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
      <button type="submit" class="su-submit">أنشئ متجري الآن 🚀</button>
    </form>
    <div class="su-perks"><span>✓ جاهز خلال 60 ثانية</span><span>✓ دفع آمن عند الاستلام</span><span>✓ توصيل لكل المحافظات</span></div>
    <p class="su-alt">عندك حساب؟ <a href="/login">سجل الدخول</a></p>
  </div>
<script>
document.getElementById('suEye')?.addEventListener('click',function(){const i=document.getElementById('suPass'); const s=i.type==='password'; i.type=s?'text':'password'; this.textContent=s?'🙈':'👁️';});
</script>
</body>
</html>
